Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value VENDOR_NAME (\S+)
Value WAVELENGTH (\d+)
Value TEMPERATURE (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value VOLTAGE (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value TX_POWER (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value RX_POWER (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)

Start
  ^\s*Name\s+VendorName\s+LaserWaveLen
  ^-+
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${VENDOR_NAME}\s+${WAVELENGTH}\s+${TEMPERATURE}\s+${VOLTAGE}\s+${TX_POWER}\s+${RX_POWER}\s*$$ -> Record
